WEBVTT

00:00:49.444 --> 00:00:54.074
DEAR X

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:56.994
ALL CHARACTERS, PLACES, AND EVENTS
IN THIS WORK ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:57.077 --> 00:00:58.620
CHILD ACTORS WERE FILMED
WITH GUARDIANS PRESENT

00:02:09.983 --> 00:02:11.235
Two, three. Clear!

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:22.829
CARDIAC PACEMAKER

00:02:49.856 --> 00:02:51.358
- One, two, three. Clear!
- At that fork

00:02:52.234 --> 00:02:54.736
where one life stands
between life and death

00:02:56.863 --> 00:02:58.991
what kind of prayer
did desperate Ah-jin

00:03:00.659 --> 00:03:02.160
offer up?

00:03:04.663 --> 00:03:06.123
At death's door

00:03:07.499 --> 00:03:09.126
was that one's life

00:03:10.711 --> 00:03:11.712
or one's end?

00:03:24.391 --> 00:03:25.392
Was that death

00:03:27.185 --> 00:03:29.604
God's answer to Ah-jin's prayer

00:03:31.398 --> 00:03:32.399
or His punishment?

00:03:47.539 --> 00:03:48.540
WITH DEEPEST CONDOLENCES

00:04:47.265 --> 00:04:48.266
No!

00:04:57.025 --> 00:04:58.693
Grandma!

00:05:25.804 --> 00:05:30.725
EPISODE 8: BEFORE JUDGMENT

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.064
SAMYUN SEOUL HOSPITAL MEMORIAL HALL

00:05:36.148 --> 00:05:38.567
NOTICE REGARDING MEDIA COVERAGE

00:06:32.287 --> 00:06:34.664
REST IN PEACE

00:06:38.877 --> 00:06:40.003
Get some rest.

00:06:40.086 --> 00:06:41.588
You'll collapse at this rate.

00:06:41.671 --> 00:06:43.423
I'll take him outside for a moment.

00:06:46.676 --> 00:06:48.470
HONG KYUNG-SUK

00:06:55.936 --> 00:06:57.979
- You two know each other?
- Yes.

00:06:58.063 --> 00:06:59.814
He helped me out a lot.

00:06:59.898 --> 00:07:02.692
And I worked part-time
at his café for a year.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:10.909
BASEBALL PLAYER CHOI ARRESTED
FOR MURDERING A PART-TIMER'S FATHER

00:07:10.992 --> 00:07:13.245
PARTIALLY ADMITTED GUILT
AND SAID "IT WAS IMPULSIVE"

00:07:25.799 --> 00:07:27.926
I was going to go home

00:07:29.261 --> 00:07:30.595
after In-gang left.

00:07:32.347 --> 00:07:34.015
But I went to her place instead.

00:07:36.393 --> 00:07:38.186
He had asked me

00:07:39.938 --> 00:07:44.901
and I remembered she hasn't been
sleeping well at night lately.

00:07:47.445 --> 00:07:49.656
I wanted to keep her company.

00:07:49.739 --> 00:07:52.909
I thought of you
as a gift from my daughter.

00:07:54.828 --> 00:07:58.415
I scolded In-gang for doubting you
and pushing you away.

00:07:59.916 --> 00:08:01.626
I reprimanded him for that.

00:08:02.544 --> 00:08:05.880
You looked so pitiful
when I first saw you

00:08:05.964 --> 00:08:08.216
so I believed
you could never do such a thing.

00:08:08.967 --> 00:08:09.968
The one who deceived me...

00:08:10.594 --> 00:08:11.595
No.

00:08:12.095 --> 00:08:14.055
The one who deceived my whole family!

00:08:15.223 --> 00:08:17.017
I foolishly trusted you

00:08:17.767 --> 00:08:20.729
and I drove my own grandson...

00:08:22.772 --> 00:08:24.733
into a bottomless pit.

00:08:31.072 --> 00:08:32.073
What...

00:08:32.991 --> 00:08:34.451
What should I do?

00:08:36.286 --> 00:08:38.663
What am I supposed to do now, Ah-jin?

00:08:40.957 --> 00:08:44.085
Can you explain what happened

00:08:44.169 --> 00:08:46.671
before and after the fall?

00:08:51.551 --> 00:08:52.761
A cat.

00:08:55.138 --> 00:08:57.098
She went out to show me

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.603
the kitten that had come by.

00:09:03.104 --> 00:09:04.105
A cat?

00:09:06.483 --> 00:09:07.692
She used to feed

00:09:09.027 --> 00:09:12.030
the stray cats in the neighborhood.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:16.368
In-mo is allergic,
so she couldn't let them inside.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:22.165
She had only put food out for them.

00:09:23.458 --> 00:09:27.462
Sometimes, the cats would bring
their kittens

00:09:28.088 --> 00:09:29.339
and show up at her door

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:32.467
at night.

00:09:33.176 --> 00:09:34.177
Please continue.

00:09:35.637 --> 00:09:37.722
After putting food out for them...

00:09:40.058 --> 00:09:41.393
she was standing up...

00:09:43.603 --> 00:09:47.440
when she suddenly swayed
as if she got dizzy.

00:09:58.034 --> 00:09:59.577
Then, she lost consciousness.

00:10:06.543 --> 00:10:07.544
I see.

00:10:08.461 --> 00:10:10.255
I know this is hard

00:10:11.673 --> 00:10:13.341
but I have a few more questions.

00:10:32.819 --> 00:10:33.903
I'll take care of it.

00:10:34.738 --> 00:10:36.948
I'll wipe every security camera
and dash cam clean

00:10:38.575 --> 00:10:39.784
so get her away from here.

00:10:40.285 --> 00:10:42.287
It's more natural
to say that I was here.

00:10:44.289 --> 00:10:45.999
And there aren't
any security cameras here.

00:10:47.667 --> 00:10:48.918
Don't do anything stupid.

00:11:03.683 --> 00:11:06.436
A grandma fell down the stairs.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.856
Please hurry.

00:11:20.909 --> 00:11:21.910
Wait!

00:11:25.163 --> 00:11:27.624
I'd like to know
exactly what kind of relationship

00:11:28.041 --> 00:11:29.334
you have with Baek Ah-jin.

00:11:29.709 --> 00:11:30.877
I looked you up.

00:11:31.252 --> 00:11:33.129
The Nojeong-dong Rooftop Murder Case.

00:11:33.755 --> 00:11:36.633
What does that have to do
with Dharma Sister Yeonhwa's passing?

00:11:36.716 --> 00:11:38.468
I read that you testified
you were caught in a trap

00:11:38.551 --> 00:11:41.054
set by the victim's daughter,
who worked part-time at your café.

00:11:41.137 --> 00:11:43.139
What exactly are you trying to ask?

00:11:44.057 --> 00:11:46.726
Is it whether there's a link

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.895
between Baek Ah-jin
and her father's murder?

00:11:48.978 --> 00:11:50.271
Can you answer that?

00:11:51.022 --> 00:11:52.315
You want an answer?

00:11:56.986 --> 00:11:59.072
Between the murder
of Mr. Baek Seon-gyu...

00:12:01.199 --> 00:12:02.909
and Ms. Baek Ah-jin...

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.081
there is no connection.

00:12:08.957 --> 00:12:09.958
Sorry?

00:12:10.041 --> 00:12:11.584
No connection whatsoever.

00:12:12.418 --> 00:12:15.129
Back then, I testified like that
out of a cowardly wish

00:12:15.213 --> 00:12:17.966
to slip through the law
because I was afraid

00:12:18.049 --> 00:12:19.467
of becoming a criminal.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.011
Which I regret now.

00:12:23.304 --> 00:12:27.183
I served five years
and paid for my crime behind bars

00:12:27.976 --> 00:12:29.477
but my debt to the deceased

00:12:30.728 --> 00:12:32.689
is something I must carry for life.

00:12:35.316 --> 00:12:36.401
Baek Ah-jin is

00:12:37.235 --> 00:12:40.071
simply a bereaved daughter
who lost her family.

00:12:40.154 --> 00:12:41.364
She's someone

00:12:42.198 --> 00:12:43.992
I must keep apologizing to
until the day I die.

00:12:44.617 --> 00:12:46.828
Since she became so famous

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:51.040
there will inevitably be
all kinds of rumors.

00:12:51.124 --> 00:12:53.042
But they're baseless.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:54.711
I'm relieved to hear that.

00:12:55.503 --> 00:12:56.963
Thank you for coming.

00:13:06.723 --> 00:13:08.474
Why did you tell him that?

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.317
It was a chance to get revenge.

00:13:20.862 --> 00:13:22.155
Why defend me?

00:13:28.912 --> 00:13:30.455
During my first year in prison...

00:13:32.999 --> 00:13:34.709
I wondered what I'd do to you

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.670
once I got out...

00:13:39.839 --> 00:13:41.090
and how to pay you back.

00:13:43.426 --> 00:13:44.552
During the second year

00:13:46.095 --> 00:13:47.472
I kept thinking...

00:13:49.933 --> 00:13:51.142
"Why me, of all people?"

00:13:53.853 --> 00:13:55.730
After the third winter...

00:13:58.358 --> 00:14:00.860
I started thinking
about what could have driven you...

00:14:03.488 --> 00:14:05.156
to do something so horrific.

00:14:07.283 --> 00:14:08.618
And the year after that...

00:14:11.621 --> 00:14:13.623
I began taking pity on you.

00:14:16.584 --> 00:14:19.754
If you had had
even one proper adult in your life

00:14:21.297 --> 00:14:22.966
as a child

00:14:23.549 --> 00:14:27.845
I thought your path
might have been different.

00:14:29.555 --> 00:14:31.015
So, in the last year

00:14:33.184 --> 00:14:34.519
I decided to pray for you.

00:14:36.729 --> 00:14:38.147
And I started wondering

00:14:39.023 --> 00:14:42.902
if I could become
that one adult for you.

00:14:46.447 --> 00:14:48.074
Once I thought about it that way

00:14:49.826 --> 00:14:51.661
I stopped resenting you.

00:14:54.205 --> 00:14:55.748
So, don't carry any guilt.

00:14:57.709 --> 00:14:58.751
What happened then

00:15:00.211 --> 00:15:01.754
was simply my fate.

00:15:03.965 --> 00:15:05.466
That sounds just like you.

00:15:06.676 --> 00:15:08.261
I'm going to root for you.

00:15:08.803 --> 00:15:09.929
That's my way.

00:15:12.515 --> 00:15:16.936
So, live your life
remembering there's someone out there

00:15:17.603 --> 00:15:20.440
who genuinely pities you

00:15:22.734 --> 00:15:23.985
and sincerely cheers for you.

00:15:26.612 --> 00:15:27.905
Try living like that.

00:15:31.784 --> 00:15:33.703
That's the best revenge I can offer.

00:15:39.876 --> 00:15:42.211
But Mr. Choi.

00:15:47.175 --> 00:15:49.427
There's no such thing
as "best revenge."

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.722
What just happened was

00:15:53.681 --> 00:15:55.683
that you missed
your one and only chance

00:15:56.726 --> 00:15:58.728
to take revenge on me.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.151
Thank you.

00:16:15.203 --> 00:16:16.746
HEO IN-GANG WAS KNOWN
TO BE DEEPLY AFFECTIONATE

00:16:16.829 --> 00:16:18.206
TOWARD HIS GRANDMOTHER...

00:16:18.289 --> 00:16:19.999
Baek Ah-jin and Heo In-gang?

00:16:20.458 --> 00:16:22.585
How long are you going to milk them?

00:16:22.668 --> 00:16:24.003
It works for the public.

00:16:24.545 --> 00:16:25.880
They're like a bone broth.

00:16:25.963 --> 00:16:28.382
You boil and boil,
and it still gives.

00:16:28.466 --> 00:16:31.344
It's about time
they broke up, though.

00:16:31.886 --> 00:16:34.180
I was going to lock in the breakup
as an exclusive

00:16:34.263 --> 00:16:35.765
and be done with it.

00:16:35.848 --> 00:16:37.934
Why split up a couple
that's doing fine?

00:16:38.017 --> 00:16:39.727
Isn't it obvious?

00:16:40.144 --> 00:16:42.647
Ah-jin is a rising sun,
and In-gang is a setting sun.

00:16:43.189 --> 00:16:46.859
She's gotten everything
she could out of him.

00:16:46.943 --> 00:16:49.529
Why would she keep dating him?

00:16:49.612 --> 00:16:51.405
Who knows?

00:16:51.489 --> 00:16:52.657
It could be true love.

00:16:55.952 --> 00:16:59.038
"True love"? You don't know anything.

00:17:27.316 --> 00:17:28.776
What do you want?

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:30.111
Oh, nothing.

00:17:30.194 --> 00:17:33.906
I'm just calling to see
if there's anything new.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:37.702
Nothing pulls clicks
like you and In-gang.

00:17:38.161 --> 00:17:40.496
We're in mourning. Show some respect.

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.248
I have something to verify--

00:17:42.331 --> 00:17:43.332
Hello?

00:17:43.749 --> 00:17:44.750
Hello...

00:17:47.128 --> 00:17:48.588
Right.

00:17:49.463 --> 00:17:51.382
For a time like this...

00:17:53.176 --> 00:17:54.177
RÉSUMÉ

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:55.469
PHOTO

00:17:56.429 --> 00:17:58.264
Hello, Ms. Sim Sung-hee?

00:17:58.681 --> 00:18:00.391
I told you I never did that.

00:18:00.474 --> 00:18:03.019
It looks like Ah-jin's side
has already made a move.

00:18:03.102 --> 00:18:04.770
Was it Longstar's CEO, Seo Mi-ri?

00:18:05.229 --> 00:18:06.772
I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:18:07.982 --> 00:18:10.276
If you're going to keep talking
nonsense, I'm hanging up.

00:18:18.159 --> 00:18:19.785
I did what you told me to.

00:18:20.453 --> 00:18:21.704
Guess you're scared, after all.

00:18:25.374 --> 00:18:26.375
Figures.

00:18:26.751 --> 00:18:29.503
Your dad's past
as an adulterous lawyer

00:18:29.795 --> 00:18:32.256
and your own past,
stealing your classmates' stuff

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:34.133
beaten by the homeroom teacher
and kids

00:18:34.217 --> 00:18:35.760
and forced to transfer.

00:18:37.011 --> 00:18:39.305
It'll look bad on you
if those spread in your workplace.

00:18:42.141 --> 00:18:44.644
You saw the comments
on your post last time, right?

00:18:45.937 --> 00:18:47.772
Plenty of people still remember you.

00:18:48.564 --> 00:18:51.108
So, unless you want
your past dragged out in the open

00:18:51.192 --> 00:18:52.693
shut your mouth and lie low.

00:18:56.239 --> 00:18:57.240
If not

00:18:58.532 --> 00:19:01.077
I'll follow you around
with your past everywhere you go.

00:19:12.588 --> 00:19:13.589
Fuck.

00:19:13.673 --> 00:19:16.968
SAMYUN SEOUL HOSPITAL MEMORIAL HALL

00:19:20.012 --> 00:19:21.013
Director.

00:19:23.182 --> 00:19:24.183
Hello.

00:19:26.352 --> 00:19:27.770
Are you heading out now?

00:19:28.187 --> 00:19:29.772
Oh, Ms. Baek Ah-jin.

00:19:30.898 --> 00:19:32.608
I'm glad you know my name.

00:19:32.692 --> 00:19:34.443
I was nervous you might not.

00:19:34.694 --> 00:19:37.196
Of course, I do.
I enjoyed your works.

00:19:37.738 --> 00:19:38.739
Thank you.

00:19:39.657 --> 00:19:41.909
I've watched all of yours as well.

00:19:42.159 --> 00:19:43.786
I'm a big fan.

00:19:43.869 --> 00:19:45.997
And In-gang talks about you so much.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:49.458
He does?
I should buy him a meal sometime.

00:19:49.542 --> 00:19:50.543
No need.

00:19:51.043 --> 00:19:52.920
Since you came today

00:19:53.004 --> 00:19:58.759
once he settles down,
let me treat you to a meal with him.

00:20:00.177 --> 00:20:01.387
What do you say?

00:20:01.637 --> 00:20:03.514
I'd love that. Anytime.

00:20:04.223 --> 00:20:06.058
For today, please stay by him

00:20:06.642 --> 00:20:08.060
and comfort him.

00:20:08.894 --> 00:20:09.895
I will.

00:20:11.772 --> 00:20:13.858
- Get home safe.
- Thanks.

00:20:17.528 --> 00:20:18.612
Ms. Baek.

00:20:20.448 --> 00:20:22.158
If you don't mind

00:20:22.241 --> 00:20:24.744
how about you drop
by my studio sometime?

00:20:28.831 --> 00:20:31.709
He must have seen Ah-jin
at In-gang's grandma's funeral.

00:20:31.959 --> 00:20:33.711
He said she was the image
he'd been looking for

00:20:33.794 --> 00:20:38.090
and wants her to play
a key role in his new work.

00:20:38.591 --> 00:20:40.384
Director Seol Yeong-uk is...

00:20:40.468 --> 00:20:42.261
It'll be invited
to the Cannes Film Festival

00:20:42.345 --> 00:20:44.889
and that naturally opens
a route into the global market.

00:20:44.972 --> 00:20:47.266
There's no better opportunity
for an actor.

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.518
It's what every actor dreams of.

00:20:52.688 --> 00:20:56.150
In-gang's grandma left Ah-jin
a big gift as she passed.

00:21:15.086 --> 00:21:16.504
You're curious, aren't you?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.508
Whether I was the one
who did it to her that night.

00:21:28.224 --> 00:21:29.600
What do you think?

00:21:31.143 --> 00:21:33.145
Do you think I could go that far?

00:21:38.109 --> 00:21:39.276
I don't get you.

00:21:43.614 --> 00:21:45.199
It must have been hard

00:21:45.449 --> 00:21:47.993
thinking about what to do with a girl
who even committed a murder.

00:21:49.328 --> 00:21:50.329
Say it.

00:21:52.832 --> 00:21:54.250
It wasn't you, right?

00:21:54.333 --> 00:21:56.794
And what happens if it were me?

00:22:02.466 --> 00:22:03.551
You're right.

00:22:05.219 --> 00:22:06.887
She started getting on my nerves.

00:22:07.888 --> 00:22:09.765
She was no use to me anymore

00:22:10.474 --> 00:22:12.184
and constantly got in my way.

00:22:14.103 --> 00:22:16.897
She had also found out
that I approached her on purpose.

00:22:20.901 --> 00:22:24.530
So, what do you think I did to her?

00:22:26.157 --> 00:22:27.158
Is that true?

00:22:27.616 --> 00:22:28.909
Did you really do it?

00:22:30.369 --> 00:22:32.079
Whatever you're thinking
is the truth.

00:22:32.163 --> 00:22:33.164
Baek Ah-jin.

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:41.213
This is so exhausting.

00:23:34.683 --> 00:23:36.519
Excuse me.

00:23:36.936 --> 00:23:39.688
You're the grandson of the lady
who lived in Unit 401, right?

00:23:43.275 --> 00:23:45.110
My grandma was crying?

00:23:45.694 --> 00:23:49.198
Yes, she was practically wailing,
so I was shocked.

00:23:49.281 --> 00:23:50.741
She normally doesn't do that.

00:23:51.242 --> 00:23:53.202
By the time she calmed down

00:23:53.285 --> 00:23:56.038
a pretty, young woman
walked into her place.

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:59.416
I brought her some red bean porridge

00:23:59.667 --> 00:24:01.794
and saw something strange
at the door.

00:24:03.087 --> 00:24:04.171
What was it?

00:24:04.255 --> 00:24:07.675
Your grandma was pounding
the young woman's chest

00:24:08.092 --> 00:24:12.304
saying things like, "I trusted you
who deceived my whole family."

00:24:12.388 --> 00:24:14.473
It was something like that.

00:24:17.017 --> 00:24:20.479
Also, the woman in Unit 409 said

00:24:20.563 --> 00:24:22.439
someone kept stealing her packages

00:24:22.523 --> 00:24:25.401
so she secretly set up
a camera in the hallway.

00:24:26.360 --> 00:24:28.904
But it's illegal

00:24:28.988 --> 00:24:31.282
so she probably didn't tell
the police.

00:24:31.365 --> 00:24:33.701
But if your grandma fell
down the stairs

00:24:33.784 --> 00:24:35.494
between the fourth and third floors

00:24:35.578 --> 00:24:37.621
it might have been filmed.

00:24:40.082 --> 00:24:43.127
Could I speak with her?

00:24:43.836 --> 00:24:46.880
My husband saved
a copy of the footage just in case

00:24:46.964 --> 00:24:48.632
but a detective came and got it.

00:24:49.174 --> 00:24:50.801
I see.

00:24:51.635 --> 00:24:52.678
Thank you.

00:25:11.238 --> 00:25:12.865
Don't ever make me do
stuff like this again.

00:25:13.532 --> 00:25:16.201
You, of all people,
should believe in Ah-jin, damn it.

00:25:18.245 --> 00:25:19.872
- Did you see it?
- No.

00:25:20.497 --> 00:25:21.540
I don't need to.

00:25:21.999 --> 00:25:23.542
I believe her. She's innocent.

00:25:33.469 --> 00:25:34.887
And don't worry about Sung-hee.

00:25:35.471 --> 00:25:37.931
I gave her a good scare, so she won't
dare open her mouth again.

00:25:38.015 --> 00:25:39.558
She won't be spreading stories
about Ah-jin.

00:25:40.392 --> 00:25:41.393
Good.

00:26:09.588 --> 00:26:11.924
In-gang, are you still in bed?

00:26:12.007 --> 00:26:13.258
Yes, why?

00:26:13.717 --> 00:26:15.636
Come on. You too?

00:26:16.637 --> 00:26:18.889
I heard you backed out of the film
you were supposed to do.

00:26:19.723 --> 00:26:22.017
We've got to hang in there
now more than ever.

00:26:22.685 --> 00:26:24.144
Don't keep starving yourself.

00:26:24.895 --> 00:26:26.355
Remember to eat.

00:26:27.564 --> 00:26:29.400
Ah-jin brought me some porridge.

00:26:30.567 --> 00:26:31.694
I'll have it later.

00:26:50.379 --> 00:26:52.923
I saw you were asleep, so I left.

00:26:53.006 --> 00:26:54.883
Don't skip meals, okay?

00:26:55.592 --> 00:26:56.635
I love you.

00:27:00.973 --> 00:27:02.307
HEO IN-GANG SPOTTED
SHOPPING FOR RINGS IN HONG KONG

00:27:03.183 --> 00:27:06.270
There are headlines saying
you're about to get married now.

00:27:06.353 --> 00:27:08.147
This is a problem, Ms. Baek.

00:27:08.397 --> 00:27:10.107
You do know

00:27:10.190 --> 00:27:12.443
what kind of character
you're playing, right?

00:27:12.526 --> 00:27:15.529
If audiences can't stay
immersed in my film

00:27:15.612 --> 00:27:18.907
because of your real-life romance
or marriage rumors

00:27:18.991 --> 00:27:21.201
I've got no reason to cast you, do I?

00:27:22.661 --> 00:27:23.662
I'm sorry.

00:27:24.371 --> 00:27:26.999
I wasn't expecting
this kind of speculation, either.

00:27:31.003 --> 00:27:34.590
I actually like
seeing you and In-gang together.

00:27:34.673 --> 00:27:38.844
I got to work with you thanks to him,
and I appreciate that.

00:27:38.927 --> 00:27:41.680
But let's keep personal
and professional matters separate.

00:27:41.764 --> 00:27:43.724
You're not dumb enough
to confuse them

00:27:44.558 --> 00:27:45.559
right?

00:27:46.727 --> 00:27:47.728
No, Director.

00:27:49.313 --> 00:27:51.148
Director, you're already here!

00:27:51.231 --> 00:27:52.691
I came as early as I could.

00:27:53.692 --> 00:27:55.444
Long time no see, Ms. Seo.

00:27:55.736 --> 00:27:56.737
Hi.

00:27:58.697 --> 00:28:01.450
I don't see Mr. Yoon, though.
Is he running late?

00:28:02.284 --> 00:28:05.454
He said
we should meet on a better day.

00:28:06.163 --> 00:28:08.665
He said today wasn't
the night for drinking.

00:28:09.792 --> 00:28:13.712
Anyway, I'll get going.
Let's talk again soon.

00:28:14.463 --> 00:28:15.589
Of course.

00:28:15.964 --> 00:28:17.174
We'll see you soon.

00:28:17.674 --> 00:28:18.884
Take care!

00:28:25.933 --> 00:28:28.143
It must have been tough
cleaning up the mess.

00:28:29.228 --> 00:28:31.939
I only posted a statement asking
to refrain from wild speculations.

00:28:32.564 --> 00:28:33.607
What about In-gang?

00:28:34.691 --> 00:28:37.027
When has he ever cared
about articles?

00:28:37.486 --> 00:28:40.030
His fans are already freaking out
that he can't get married yet.

00:28:40.697 --> 00:28:42.574
But he's talking about retiring
once his contract's over.

00:28:42.658 --> 00:28:44.076
It's driving me insane.

00:28:47.120 --> 00:28:49.039
He really said that?

00:28:50.833 --> 00:28:52.251
He didn't tell you?

00:28:52.751 --> 00:28:54.711
I had my phone turned off.

00:28:55.671 --> 00:28:57.923
It was getting too chaotic
due to all the calls coming in.

00:29:01.927 --> 00:29:04.638
You didn't know
about the ring, either, did you?

00:29:06.223 --> 00:29:07.224
No.

00:29:09.101 --> 00:29:11.144
Are you going to marry him?

00:29:16.400 --> 00:29:18.402
No, I'm going to end it.

00:29:19.611 --> 00:29:20.988
You'll back me up, right?

00:29:23.448 --> 00:29:24.449
Ah-jin.

00:29:25.075 --> 00:29:26.743
While preparing for your birthday

00:29:27.911 --> 00:29:29.913
I realized

00:29:29.997 --> 00:29:32.332
it was the first time in my life
I had ever felt so deeply grateful

00:29:33.000 --> 00:29:34.126
that someone was born.

00:29:35.294 --> 00:29:40.382
I suddenly understood how huge
my feelings for you had become.

00:29:41.800 --> 00:29:43.051
This must be love.

00:29:44.845 --> 00:29:46.805
Let's share our lives together.

00:29:48.348 --> 00:29:51.101
Let's fill and exchange our love

00:29:51.935 --> 00:29:53.145
within the same everyday life.

00:29:54.605 --> 00:29:55.898
I want to marry you.

00:29:57.482 --> 00:29:58.609
You're home, right?

00:30:10.996 --> 00:30:13.290
I'll be at your place in ten minutes.

00:30:13.832 --> 00:30:14.833
We need to talk.

00:30:18.587 --> 00:30:20.505
Will you stay by my side?

00:30:40.400 --> 00:30:41.610
What are you hesitating about?

00:30:41.985 --> 00:30:43.278
Is it something exciting?

00:30:44.613 --> 00:30:45.697
Something scary.

00:30:45.948 --> 00:30:47.866
I'm not sure if I can handle it.

00:30:47.950 --> 00:30:48.992
Scary?

00:30:49.368 --> 00:30:50.369
Like what?

00:30:51.161 --> 00:30:52.371
It's just scary.

00:30:54.873 --> 00:30:56.458
Then throw it away.

00:30:56.541 --> 00:30:57.751
I wish I could.

00:31:04.007 --> 00:31:06.218
Why isn't he home yet?

00:31:11.848 --> 00:31:12.975
Man.

00:31:14.601 --> 00:31:15.602
What are you doing?

00:31:16.770 --> 00:31:18.313
Wait, who are you?

00:31:19.022 --> 00:31:20.023
"Who are you?"

00:31:20.107 --> 00:31:21.108
Are you serious?

00:31:21.650 --> 00:31:24.069
Don't you even remember the guy
you hugged last time?

00:31:25.988 --> 00:31:27.280
Go make some ramyeon.

00:31:27.906 --> 00:31:28.907
I'm sorry?

00:31:30.993 --> 00:31:32.786
It's for Jun-seo's stomach.

00:31:33.578 --> 00:31:35.872
He needs something spicy to sober up.

00:31:39.209 --> 00:31:40.752
Jackass.

00:32:00.272 --> 00:32:01.273
Gosh.

00:32:26.048 --> 00:32:28.508
I was worried
something had happened to you.

00:32:30.343 --> 00:32:31.970
It relieves me to see your face.

00:32:35.682 --> 00:32:38.894
In-gang,
are you thinking of retiring?

00:32:41.521 --> 00:32:42.773
Did Mi-ri tell you?

00:32:44.357 --> 00:32:46.735
Why didn't you tell me first?

00:32:47.652 --> 00:32:49.279
I didn't mean to hide it.

00:32:50.155 --> 00:32:52.407
It wasn't easy to make up my mind.

00:32:52.783 --> 00:32:55.660
I was going to tell you
once I was sure.

00:33:04.169 --> 00:33:08.381
Are you planning to marry me
after you retire?

00:33:13.261 --> 00:33:15.013
I thought we were on the same page.

00:33:17.057 --> 00:33:18.183
Was I wrong?

00:33:20.018 --> 00:33:22.729
Then you shouldn't have let it
become news.

00:33:23.355 --> 00:33:24.397
What?

00:33:27.859 --> 00:33:29.820
I feel awful.

00:33:31.571 --> 00:33:32.697
Do you have any idea

00:33:32.781 --> 00:33:34.658
how humiliated I was
in front of the director today?

00:33:36.159 --> 00:33:37.577
Why should I have to take

00:33:38.245 --> 00:33:39.788
that kind of criticism
because of you?

00:33:42.165 --> 00:33:43.166
Ah-jin.

00:33:48.296 --> 00:33:49.673
Let me ask you one favor.

00:33:51.341 --> 00:33:54.761
You're a good guy who always
does me a favor when I ask

00:33:55.011 --> 00:33:57.305
so I hope you do it again this time.

00:34:01.601 --> 00:34:03.478
Let's break up.

00:34:12.571 --> 00:34:13.822
Hang on.

00:34:14.489 --> 00:34:16.408
What kind of nonsense is this?

00:34:16.491 --> 00:34:18.326
This is too sudden.

00:34:19.578 --> 00:34:21.037
I know you're angry, but...

00:34:22.873 --> 00:34:24.749
Are you even the same Ah-jin I know?

00:34:24.833 --> 00:34:28.336
And are you the In-gang I know?

00:34:29.629 --> 00:34:31.506
You're not in your right mind.

00:34:32.257 --> 00:34:33.925
You can't even control your emotions

00:34:34.009 --> 00:34:36.094
babbling about retiring
and fairy-tale dreams.

00:34:36.178 --> 00:34:37.888
Get a grip.

00:34:38.722 --> 00:34:42.642
Do you know how many fans you've lost
in the year we've been together?

00:34:42.893 --> 00:34:45.103
And now you want me to marry you?

00:34:47.355 --> 00:34:50.066
Don't make me laugh.
And what about me?

00:34:51.401 --> 00:34:53.612
You want to put
a "married woman" label on me

00:34:53.695 --> 00:34:56.948
while I lose my movie roles,
so I can watch as my career dies?

00:34:58.950 --> 00:35:02.621
How can a person change
so completely overnight?

00:35:03.872 --> 00:35:04.873
Why?

00:35:07.626 --> 00:35:09.419
You don't like the new me?

00:35:10.837 --> 00:35:13.882
Then would you rather have me
smile sweetly

00:35:15.258 --> 00:35:16.801
while I break up with you?

00:35:18.637 --> 00:35:20.347
Would that make it easier for you?

00:35:25.602 --> 00:35:27.062
We've been together a year.

00:35:28.980 --> 00:35:32.192
I thought I knew you,
and I was certain about us.

00:35:33.693 --> 00:35:35.820
That's why I pictured
a future together.

00:35:36.947 --> 00:35:38.406
Was that so wrong?

00:35:39.199 --> 00:35:41.201
You know how much pain
I'm in right now.

00:35:42.577 --> 00:35:43.745
Can't you even try to understand--

00:35:43.828 --> 00:35:46.164
Why should I understand you?

00:35:47.499 --> 00:35:49.417
It wasn't ten years,
not even five years.

00:35:49.501 --> 00:35:52.337
Who cares
about a one-year relationship?

00:35:52.963 --> 00:35:55.507
You thought I knew you? Well, I...

00:35:57.968 --> 00:36:00.470
I've never heard
such an arrogant thing in my life.

00:36:05.392 --> 00:36:07.060
I can't believe this.

00:36:09.145 --> 00:36:10.772
I wish this were a dream.

00:36:12.357 --> 00:36:14.234
Given your tragic life

00:36:14.317 --> 00:36:16.027
I'm probably not
even nightmare-worthy.

00:36:18.321 --> 00:36:21.241
Don't make a scene over something
as ordinary as a breakup.

00:36:28.248 --> 00:36:29.457
Ah-jin, what's wrong?

00:36:29.541 --> 00:36:30.583
Come on.

00:36:32.669 --> 00:36:34.504
- Don't do this.
- In-gang.

00:36:37.841 --> 00:36:38.967
What I'm about to say

00:36:40.135 --> 00:36:41.344
will hurt.

00:36:48.810 --> 00:36:50.437
I'm already hurting.

00:36:54.065 --> 00:36:55.608
You were pretending ignorance.

00:37:11.374 --> 00:37:12.500
But listen anyway.

00:37:13.877 --> 00:37:15.045
Don't try to avoid it.

00:37:21.051 --> 00:37:22.260
Your grandma's notebook.

00:37:24.721 --> 00:37:26.014
I stole it.

00:37:29.434 --> 00:37:32.812
I wanted to win her favor
so I could date you.

00:37:34.898 --> 00:37:38.151
She found it at my place a while ago

00:37:39.361 --> 00:37:40.570
and she found out...

00:37:42.405 --> 00:37:43.782
what kind of person I am.

00:37:46.034 --> 00:37:47.160
And from that shock

00:37:48.411 --> 00:37:49.412
she...

00:37:54.125 --> 00:37:55.835
You understand what I mean, right?

00:38:03.093 --> 00:38:04.094
In-gang.

00:38:06.388 --> 00:38:07.389
How you fell

00:38:09.349 --> 00:38:11.309
in love with me...

00:38:13.728 --> 00:38:15.397
and what happened to your grandma--

00:38:15.480 --> 00:38:16.773
What the hell did you do?

00:38:19.234 --> 00:38:20.235
All I did was...

00:38:22.987 --> 00:38:24.948
tell her the truth.

00:38:27.409 --> 00:38:30.078
I asked what you did to my grandma!

00:38:36.751 --> 00:38:38.503
I simply told her honestly.

00:38:39.963 --> 00:38:42.632
For once in my life.

00:39:01.609 --> 00:39:02.777
Say that again.

00:39:07.198 --> 00:39:08.700
If you don't let go of me now

00:39:09.617 --> 00:39:12.203
you'll be in hell
every time you think of her.

00:39:13.413 --> 00:39:15.957
You're not the type of person
who can handle that.

00:39:19.461 --> 00:39:20.545
So, admit it.

00:39:21.838 --> 00:39:24.007
Our ending was already decided.

00:39:28.178 --> 00:39:30.054
I'll release the breakup article

00:39:30.138 --> 00:39:33.516
through a reporter I know
at the right time.

00:39:34.392 --> 00:39:39.397
The reason will be
"grew apart due to busy schedules."

00:39:40.899 --> 00:39:42.233
About Ms. Seo...

00:39:44.777 --> 00:39:46.738
I'll tell her myself,
so get some rest for now.

00:39:48.531 --> 00:39:50.658
You look like you haven't slept
since your grandma passed.

00:39:53.912 --> 00:39:54.913
Get a good sleep.

00:40:41.626 --> 00:40:43.169
It's me, Mr. Lim.

00:40:43.253 --> 00:40:45.129
What is it, at this hour?

00:40:45.213 --> 00:40:47.632
I think it's time to end
our little arrangement.

00:40:48.341 --> 00:40:49.342
What?

00:40:49.592 --> 00:40:51.719
Don't tell me
you're going to marry In-gang.

00:40:51.803 --> 00:40:53.179
No, it's the opposite.

00:40:53.263 --> 00:40:54.264
The opposite?

00:40:54.347 --> 00:40:56.599
Get a breakup article ready for us.

00:40:56.683 --> 00:40:58.393
Breakup? Hold on.

00:40:58.476 --> 00:41:01.521
Just write we drifted apart
due to our busy schedules.

00:41:01.604 --> 00:41:04.315
- You're seriously going through--
- As quickly as possible, please.

00:41:07.151 --> 00:41:10.029
CEO SEO MI-RI

00:41:22.375 --> 00:41:23.418
Hey, Boss.

00:41:23.501 --> 00:41:24.502
Where are you?

00:41:39.934 --> 00:41:42.145
Boss, don't pull over.
Just keep driving.

00:41:42.228 --> 00:41:43.521
You've got a tail behind you.

00:42:19.974 --> 00:42:21.184
Who are you?

00:42:21.476 --> 00:42:23.353
Are you a stalker?

00:42:23.645 --> 00:42:24.646
Or gangsters?

00:42:25.188 --> 00:42:27.065
You've got nothing better
to do with your lives?

00:42:28.691 --> 00:42:29.692
Get out.

00:42:50.421 --> 00:42:51.422
Get him.

00:42:52.131 --> 00:42:53.841
- No!
- Punk.

00:43:13.945 --> 00:43:14.987
Let's stop all this.

00:43:15.238 --> 00:43:17.115
Forget about Ah-jin now.

00:43:30.503 --> 00:43:32.672
She's not the right girl for you.

00:43:32.755 --> 00:43:34.215
We won't renew her contract, either.

00:43:35.007 --> 00:43:36.175
I know.

00:43:38.302 --> 00:43:41.180
All lovers break up in the end.

00:43:44.350 --> 00:43:46.310
This kind of breakup happens
to everybody.

00:43:48.813 --> 00:43:50.064
Just today.

00:43:51.774 --> 00:43:53.985
I'll let it hurt just for today.

00:43:59.741 --> 00:44:00.950
Just for today?

00:44:08.750 --> 00:44:11.085
Fine. Let's drink, then.

00:44:14.964 --> 00:44:16.716
Let's get totally wasted tonight.

00:44:20.845 --> 00:44:22.472
It brings back old memories.

00:44:28.519 --> 00:44:29.562
Thanks, Mi-ri.

00:44:31.105 --> 00:44:32.106
For what?

00:44:36.986 --> 00:44:37.987
Thank you.

00:44:41.282 --> 00:44:42.283
Silly.

00:44:42.867 --> 00:44:44.285
Pour me some more. Is this a joke?

00:45:10.353 --> 00:45:11.354
AH-JIN

00:45:23.741 --> 00:45:24.951
Hey, Ah-jin.

00:45:25.451 --> 00:45:27.954
Jae-oh, who was in that car
that was following me?

00:45:30.414 --> 00:45:31.415
Paparazzi.

00:45:32.667 --> 00:45:34.544
I talked to them and sent them away

00:45:35.294 --> 00:45:36.295
so don't worry.

00:45:38.631 --> 00:45:41.175
You didn't call me out
for something urgent, right?

00:45:42.009 --> 00:45:45.388
No, I'm a little tired today.
I'll talk to you later.

00:45:47.598 --> 00:45:48.975
I'll call you.

00:46:26.345 --> 00:46:27.430
What?

00:46:27.513 --> 00:46:29.140
HEO IN-GANG AND BAEK AH-JIN
BREAK UP AFTER 1 YEAR

00:46:29.223 --> 00:46:30.516
GREW DISTANT DUE TO BUSY SCHEDULES

00:46:30.600 --> 00:46:32.101
THE FAMOUS COUPLE
HEO IN-GANG AND BAEK AH-JIN

00:46:32.184 --> 00:46:33.728
ENDED THEIR RELATIONSHIP
AFTER A TURBULENT YEAR

00:46:41.694 --> 00:46:43.362
Ms. Seo, these documents are for you.

00:46:44.280 --> 00:46:46.115
Yes, fix the parts I marked.

00:46:47.366 --> 00:46:48.451
Where's In-gang?

00:46:48.701 --> 00:46:49.952
His manager called and said

00:46:50.036 --> 00:46:51.954
he just went to bed
after taking sleeping pills.

00:46:53.581 --> 00:46:55.416
He won't be up
until late afternoon, then.

00:46:56.000 --> 00:46:57.209
That brat probably skipped food

00:46:57.293 --> 00:46:58.836
and poured alcohol
into an empty stomach.

00:47:01.130 --> 00:47:03.299
Is there
a good hangover-soup place nearby?

00:47:04.050 --> 00:47:05.551
Are you taking it to him?

00:47:05.635 --> 00:47:07.678
I'll swing by his place
on my way home.

00:47:08.471 --> 00:47:12.058
I need to make him eat something
and pull himself together.

00:47:44.674 --> 00:47:46.592
I'm out of town right now

00:47:46.676 --> 00:47:48.344
but In-gang isn't picking up
the phone.

00:47:48.803 --> 00:47:51.180
He's just passed out
from drinking too much.

00:47:51.263 --> 00:47:52.765
I'm heading over
with hangover soup now.

00:47:52.848 --> 00:47:55.434
I'll feed him
and tell him to call you.

00:47:55.518 --> 00:47:56.519
Yes.

00:47:56.602 --> 00:47:58.270
Don't worry, In-mo.
Focus on your work.

00:47:58.354 --> 00:47:59.480
Okay.

00:48:22.586 --> 00:48:25.172
In-gang, wake up!
Time to fix that hangover.

00:48:26.382 --> 00:48:30.261
I brought you
some amazing hangover soup.

00:48:37.184 --> 00:48:39.478
He's still asleep, huh?

00:48:41.731 --> 00:48:42.940
In-gang!

00:48:46.694 --> 00:48:48.696
Where is he?

00:50:26.001 --> 00:50:27.002
In-gang.

00:50:29.088 --> 00:50:30.422
In-gang, no.

00:50:32.550 --> 00:50:34.677
No!

00:50:36.095 --> 00:50:38.514
No!

00:51:16.218 --> 00:51:17.219
Hey.

00:51:18.053 --> 00:51:19.346
Look at me.

00:51:20.389 --> 00:51:21.390
Ridiculous, right?

00:51:26.478 --> 00:51:27.479
What happened?

00:51:28.063 --> 00:51:29.481
You've never been this hurt.

00:51:29.982 --> 00:51:31.108
What have you been doing?

00:51:33.485 --> 00:51:36.322
I just got unlucky.

00:51:38.324 --> 00:51:39.325
How's Boss?

00:51:40.659 --> 00:51:41.660
What?

00:51:42.077 --> 00:51:43.120
Is she all right?

00:51:43.621 --> 00:51:44.747
Why are you asking that?

00:51:47.333 --> 00:51:49.043
As long as nothing happened to her.

00:52:00.638 --> 00:52:02.348
Who the hell were those guys, anyway?

00:52:02.431 --> 00:52:03.974
Heo In-gang is dead.

00:52:05.226 --> 00:52:06.602
Seriously? Was it suicide?

00:52:07.102 --> 00:52:09.355
But he recently broke up
with Baek Ah-jin.

00:52:09.438 --> 00:52:12.358
Wait, does that mean
he killed himself because of her?

00:52:12.441 --> 00:52:13.817
That can't be.

00:52:13.901 --> 00:52:15.194
Apparently, he had depression.

00:52:50.521 --> 00:52:52.356
What did you say to me before?

00:52:52.606 --> 00:52:54.400
What did you say to me last time?

00:52:56.235 --> 00:52:58.696
You said you were just going to have
a normal relationship and break up.

00:52:58.779 --> 00:53:01.198
You said yourself
that he wouldn't get hurt.

00:53:01.991 --> 00:53:03.242
You're hilarious.

00:53:03.867 --> 00:53:04.868
Why are you angry?

00:53:06.495 --> 00:53:08.289
Who are you to yell at me?

00:53:10.124 --> 00:53:12.334
He couldn't accept the breakup.
That's on him.

00:53:12.418 --> 00:53:14.086
I did everything I could.

00:53:14.712 --> 00:53:16.130
How is that my fault?

00:53:16.797 --> 00:53:19.925
It was bad luck on his part
that he ended up like that.

00:53:21.635 --> 00:53:23.053
That's not my fault.

00:53:28.309 --> 00:53:29.685
He's dead.

00:53:31.145 --> 00:53:33.689
An entire family was shattered
in an instant.

00:53:36.317 --> 00:53:37.735
And that's all you have to say?

00:53:38.819 --> 00:53:41.405
You make it sound like I killed him.

00:53:41.488 --> 00:53:42.531
Didn't you?

00:53:44.700 --> 00:53:47.494
Did you think I'd feel guilty?

00:53:47.578 --> 00:53:49.163
Don't expect that from me.

00:53:49.747 --> 00:53:51.623
You're the only one
who'll end up hurt and disappointed.

00:53:57.963 --> 00:53:59.006
Can't you just...

00:54:00.841 --> 00:54:02.551
live like a normal person?

00:54:08.015 --> 00:54:09.975
It was my mistake
for thinking you had

00:54:10.059 --> 00:54:11.894
even a shred of humanity in you.

00:54:13.479 --> 00:54:15.731
How exactly
am I supposed to be human?

00:54:16.607 --> 00:54:19.360
Do you think things would have
turned out differently

00:54:19.443 --> 00:54:21.362
if you had pulled me
out of that bathtub?

00:54:22.404 --> 00:54:24.114
But you didn't.

00:54:24.198 --> 00:54:26.533
Jae-oh would have stormed
into the bathroom

00:54:26.617 --> 00:54:29.328
and smashed that woman's head,
but you didn't.

00:54:29.870 --> 00:54:32.122
And you dare to judge me?

00:54:35.959 --> 00:54:39.254
Did you just stand there and watch
because you had humanity?

00:54:41.298 --> 00:54:43.050
This isn't my fault.

00:54:44.093 --> 00:54:45.928
You made me like this.

00:54:48.639 --> 00:54:51.642
If you feel bad for me,
say you're sorry.

00:54:52.726 --> 00:54:55.396
Say you're sorry
you turned me into this.

00:54:56.897 --> 00:54:58.482
When you condemn me

00:54:58.565 --> 00:55:00.275
you're actually condemning
your past self.

00:55:10.452 --> 00:55:12.329
You can blame me all you want

00:55:13.747 --> 00:55:15.374
but I'll never blame you.

00:55:25.175 --> 00:55:28.095
If you want to leave me, then do it.

00:55:32.516 --> 00:55:34.560
Run away from me

00:55:35.060 --> 00:55:36.687
just like you did in the past...

00:55:38.730 --> 00:55:41.066
and I still won't blame you.

00:55:47.197 --> 00:55:50.117
Because you're the first person
I chose to keep by my side.

00:56:30.824 --> 00:56:33.911
I was afraid my grandma
wouldn't be able to get her surgery.

00:56:34.870 --> 00:56:36.497
Thank you, Manager.

00:56:37.164 --> 00:56:38.624
I'll never forget this.

00:56:38.707 --> 00:56:40.334
I'm not a manager anymore.

00:56:40.417 --> 00:56:42.961
You can call me CEO now.

00:56:43.045 --> 00:56:44.171
And just so you know

00:56:44.254 --> 00:56:46.381
I never forget
a favor I gave, either.

00:56:46.465 --> 00:56:47.674
Thank you, truly.

00:56:50.219 --> 00:56:51.220
Hello.

00:56:56.850 --> 00:56:58.602
You said you never forget
a favor you've done.

00:56:58.852 --> 00:57:00.521
I wish you massive success, Ms. Seo.

00:57:02.147 --> 00:57:03.440
Thank you.

00:57:05.025 --> 00:57:07.236
REPRESENTATIVE: SEO MI-RI
NAME: HEO IN-GANG

00:57:10.906 --> 00:57:12.824
I never forget
the favors I receive, either.

00:57:13.242 --> 00:57:14.785
I sure know
how to pick the right people.

00:57:23.085 --> 00:57:26.296
I just want to thank you.

00:57:41.687 --> 00:57:44.273
HEO IN-GANG

00:58:55.594 --> 00:58:57.346
Everyone ends up abandoned

00:58:58.013 --> 00:58:59.264
and broken in life.

00:59:00.557 --> 00:59:02.434
You were just too weak.

00:59:13.779 --> 00:59:15.947
I couldn't just fall apart with you.

00:59:26.166 --> 00:59:27.542
Please understand me.

01:00:00.117 --> 01:00:01.952
- Kick her out!
- Kick her out!

01:00:02.035 --> 01:00:03.620
Kick Baek Ah-jin out!

01:00:03.704 --> 01:00:05.455
- Kick her out!
- Kick her out!

01:00:05.539 --> 01:00:06.957
This is unfair!

01:00:07.040 --> 01:00:08.834
- Unfair!
- Unfair!

01:00:08.917 --> 01:00:10.711
Take responsibility, Longstar!

01:00:10.794 --> 01:00:12.629
- Take responsibility!
- Take responsibility!

01:00:12.713 --> 01:00:14.339
This is unfair!

01:00:14.423 --> 01:00:16.341
- Unfair!
- Unfair!

01:00:16.425 --> 01:00:18.218
Baek Ah-jin is a criminal!

01:00:18.301 --> 01:00:20.178
- Criminal!
- Criminal!

01:00:20.262 --> 01:00:21.972
Kick Baek Ah-jin out!

01:00:22.055 --> 01:00:23.974
- Kick her out!
- Kick her out!

01:00:24.057 --> 01:00:25.684
Bring In-gang back!

01:00:25.767 --> 01:00:27.436
- Bring him back!
- Bring him back!

01:00:27.519 --> 01:00:29.604
Take responsibility, Longstar!

01:00:29.688 --> 01:00:31.690
- Take responsibility!
- Take responsibility!

01:00:31.773 --> 01:00:33.483
Bring In-gang back!

01:00:33.567 --> 01:00:35.485
- Bring him back!
- Bring him back!

01:00:35.569 --> 01:00:36.570
Baek Ah-jin!

01:00:37.821 --> 01:00:40.115
- Bring him back.
- Bring In-gang back.

01:00:40.866 --> 01:00:42.784
- Devil!
- You're the worst!

01:00:43.493 --> 01:00:45.036
Who are you? Move!

01:00:45.620 --> 01:00:47.956
I was her classmate.

01:00:48.039 --> 01:00:49.833
She doesn't deserve all this insult!

01:00:49.916 --> 01:00:51.960
- Where do you think you're going?
- Go away!

01:00:52.043 --> 01:00:54.546
- Come back here!
- Baek Ah-jin!

01:00:54.629 --> 01:00:57.257
- You're a devil!
- Bring him back to life!

01:00:58.216 --> 01:01:01.261
- Stop!
- Bring In-gang back!

01:01:01.553 --> 01:01:03.054
- Get away from her!
- Come here!

01:01:04.181 --> 01:01:05.891
Who the heck is she?

01:01:11.271 --> 01:01:14.357
Hey, I'm all filthy because of you,
so let me wash up first.

01:01:15.525 --> 01:01:17.068
Seriously.

01:01:17.903 --> 01:01:18.904
Hey.

01:01:24.159 --> 01:01:26.453
You have a nice place.

01:01:47.098 --> 01:01:48.767
So fancy.

01:01:49.768 --> 01:01:50.769
This is insane.

01:01:54.189 --> 01:01:56.149
You have lots of nice clothes.

01:01:59.069 --> 01:02:00.278
I missed you.

01:02:01.154 --> 01:02:03.031
Not bad for an orphan.

01:02:04.825 --> 01:02:06.409
You're successful now.

01:02:06.493 --> 01:02:07.786
Impressive, friend.

01:02:13.667 --> 01:02:16.711
Bring me some booze.
You drink, right?

01:02:17.671 --> 01:02:18.672
Right?

01:02:23.718 --> 01:02:24.761
Get out of my house.

01:02:28.431 --> 01:02:30.475
You used to run loan-shark schemes
on kids back in school

01:02:30.559 --> 01:02:32.602
and now look at you.

01:02:35.814 --> 01:02:37.524
Let me try that scheme, too.

01:02:39.067 --> 01:02:40.277
How about 100,000 won a day?

01:02:45.740 --> 01:02:48.618
Don't pick fights you can't win,
and get out.

01:02:52.581 --> 01:02:53.582
Fine.

01:02:54.165 --> 01:02:55.166
For now...

01:02:58.545 --> 01:03:00.171
I'll take this and call it even.

01:03:07.888 --> 01:03:09.598
The public sentiment
is extremely negative.

01:03:09.681 --> 01:03:12.434
Longstar also hasn't made
a clear statement yet

01:03:12.517 --> 01:03:14.561
so speculative articles
are flooding in.

01:03:16.354 --> 01:03:20.191
The agency's actor is under attack,
and they're merely watching?

01:03:32.787 --> 01:03:35.081
I know you were digging
into Ah-jin's father's death

01:03:35.165 --> 01:03:37.417
and stopped
when you started working with her.

01:03:39.544 --> 01:03:41.546
I suggest you work with me now.

01:03:44.716 --> 01:03:47.010
We may not be able
to reopen the whole case

01:03:47.093 --> 01:03:48.929
but this will be enough
to drag her down

01:03:49.012 --> 01:03:50.722
since she lives off public image.

01:03:52.015 --> 01:03:53.224
Is this everything?

01:03:53.308 --> 01:03:54.517
Just a portion.

01:03:55.477 --> 01:03:58.563
I'll give you the rest
as soon as you agree.

01:03:59.105 --> 01:04:01.524
Think about it and get back to me.

01:04:02.776 --> 01:04:03.985
Ms. Seo.

01:04:05.487 --> 01:04:07.405
You do know timing is everything
with exposés, right?

01:04:07.489 --> 01:04:08.657
About that timing...

01:04:09.991 --> 01:04:12.243
The sooner, the better.

01:04:50.240 --> 01:04:51.366
What are you doing?

01:04:52.701 --> 01:04:53.702
I'm sorry.

01:04:55.412 --> 01:04:56.413
Ah-jin.

01:04:57.872 --> 01:04:59.582
Is this a new persona
you're trying out?

01:05:02.836 --> 01:05:04.337
Sorry about what, exactly?

01:05:05.672 --> 01:05:08.133
I truly want to apologize.

01:05:11.803 --> 01:05:13.263
For everything I've done...

01:05:15.849 --> 01:05:17.017
I'm sorry.

01:05:18.852 --> 01:05:19.853
Ah-jin.

01:05:21.730 --> 01:05:22.731
After all this time?

01:05:34.325 --> 01:05:36.202
I'm even on my knees.

01:05:39.247 --> 01:05:42.333
Won't you please accept my apology?

01:05:43.752 --> 01:05:44.753
Please?

01:05:58.516 --> 01:05:59.517
Why should I?

01:06:01.102 --> 01:06:03.646
Why should I accept your apology?

01:06:07.317 --> 01:06:08.318
Ms. Hwang.

01:06:08.943 --> 01:06:10.445
For kneeling once?

01:06:12.280 --> 01:06:14.240
Considering everything
you've done to me

01:06:14.324 --> 01:06:16.826
your knees should be
worn down to the bones.

01:06:21.664 --> 01:06:23.333
Deep down, you've been waiting

01:06:24.501 --> 01:06:25.752
for my apology.

01:06:31.549 --> 01:06:32.717
I don't need it.

01:06:35.887 --> 01:06:36.888
Is that right?

01:06:42.268 --> 01:06:43.853
Well, I apologized.

01:06:50.401 --> 01:06:52.278
Don't forget to tell Jun-seo

01:06:53.238 --> 01:06:55.657
that I came and apologized.

01:06:58.618 --> 01:07:00.411
Make sure he knows

01:07:01.496 --> 01:07:02.622
I got on my knees.

01:08:43.932 --> 01:08:44.933
Do you know...

01:08:49.187 --> 01:08:51.981
when I hated you the most?

01:09:17.924 --> 01:09:20.510
I asked what you did to my grandma!

01:09:22.345 --> 01:09:23.471
I admit

01:09:24.430 --> 01:09:27.433
that was my intention at first.

01:09:29.894 --> 01:09:31.145
But...

01:09:37.235 --> 01:09:38.653
I liked

01:09:39.946 --> 01:09:41.364
In-gang so much.

01:09:45.201 --> 01:09:46.411
So, I...

01:09:49.872 --> 01:09:53.459
wanted you to love me, too.

01:10:03.428 --> 01:10:05.513
I'll take care of it.

01:10:11.728 --> 01:10:13.521
I'll tell

01:10:15.398 --> 01:10:17.608
In-gang the truth...

01:10:21.279 --> 01:10:22.613
and end this.

01:10:30.955 --> 01:10:32.206
Look at me.

01:10:45.345 --> 01:10:47.263
I still stand by it.

01:10:51.142 --> 01:10:52.143
The fact

01:10:53.728 --> 01:10:55.563
that you're also one of my children

01:10:57.023 --> 01:10:59.108
just like In-gang and In-mo.

01:11:01.152 --> 01:11:03.821
When your child does wrong,
you scold them

01:11:04.781 --> 01:11:06.366
and embrace them again.

01:11:08.910 --> 01:11:10.370
That's what a parent does.

01:11:26.135 --> 01:11:27.387
Ah-jin.

01:11:28.721 --> 01:11:29.931
Baek Ah-jin.

01:11:31.849 --> 01:11:32.850
Yes?

01:11:33.935 --> 01:11:35.395
You did wrong, didn't you?

01:11:41.526 --> 01:11:43.277
You won't do it again, right?

01:11:49.867 --> 01:11:51.285
That's good enough.

01:11:54.372 --> 01:11:55.373
Ah-jin.

01:11:57.291 --> 01:11:59.085
Here's what we should do.

01:12:00.753 --> 01:12:04.590
We'll keep this just between us

01:12:05.508 --> 01:12:06.717
and never tell anyone.

01:12:16.602 --> 01:12:19.605
My other babies must have arrived.

01:12:26.904 --> 01:12:28.573
Do you want to meet them?

01:12:37.707 --> 01:12:38.791
I hated you the most

01:12:41.169 --> 01:12:43.588
when you were kind to me
every once in a while.

01:12:54.140 --> 01:12:56.267
Because I would be tricked
by your kindness

01:12:58.311 --> 01:13:00.563
and start to fall for it.

01:13:07.278 --> 01:13:09.947
I was afraid of having
even a tiny bit of false hope.

01:13:15.703 --> 01:13:17.121
That's what scared me.

01:14:14.971 --> 01:14:17.014
Come on. Come.

01:17:02.930 --> 01:17:04.557
But now I know for sure.

01:17:27.538 --> 01:17:29.832
It's all my fault.

01:17:32.376 --> 01:17:33.711
Save her life.

01:17:38.549 --> 01:17:40.426
Please save her life.

01:17:41.385 --> 01:17:42.970
In hell, hope is...

01:17:47.808 --> 01:17:49.685
something you should never hold onto.

01:18:54.458 --> 01:18:56.585
They don't seem to know
who we are yet.

01:18:56.669 --> 01:18:58.546
It looks like he followed us
by coincidence.

01:18:58.629 --> 01:19:00.923
She's hospitalized at the moment.

01:19:01.590 --> 01:19:02.758
What would you have me do?

01:19:06.220 --> 01:19:07.346
Let's observe for now.

01:19:08.681 --> 01:19:12.226
Find out exactly
how they're connected.

01:19:12.309 --> 01:19:13.310
Yes, sir.

01:20:29.511 --> 01:20:33.849
DEAR X

01:22:53.363 --> 01:22:55.365
Subtitles by Ho-young Yun